The code was written for SigmaM2M, a oneM2M platform, from the OMA LwM2M
technical specifications and the RFCs they reference (PROVENANCE.md). It
contains no code from other projects. The source files that come from
SigmaM2M (codec.go, lwm2mcbor.go, model.go, codec_conformance_test.go)
carry no per-file copyright header, the convention of the code they come
from; the copyright line above covers them. Files added for this module
carry "Copyright 2026 Abhinav Gautam" and "SPDX-License-Identifier:
Apache-2.0".

