Object model data (OMNA LwM2M registry)
---------------------------------------

The built-in object model in model.go (object and resource IDs, data
types, which resources are executable, which objects exist) is a set of
facts taken from the object definitions of the OMNA LwM2M registry,
https://github.com/OpenMobileAlliance/lwm2m-registry (objects 0, 1, 3,
4, 5, 9, 21, 25, 26, and 3303 from IPSO). No registry file is included
and no description text was copied; resource names are our own short
identifiers and units are UCUM codes. Credit: the Open Mobile Alliance
(OMA SpecWorks) and the IPSO Alliance for the object definitions. The
registry's object definition files carry this licence:

