interop/peer/Dockerfile downloads Eclipse Leshan's demo client, server
and bootstrap server 2.0.0-M18 (Eclipse Public License 2.0 or Eclipse
Distribution License 1.0, Copyright the Leshan contributors) from Maven
Central into an eclipse-temurin:21-jre-alpine image at test time; nothing
of Leshan is copied into this repository. The interop module also uses
github.com/plgd-dev/go-coap/v3 (Apache-2.0) and its dependencies
(github.com/pion/dtls/v3, pion/logging and pion/transport: MIT;
golang.org/x/*: BSD-3-Clause; go.uber.org/atomic: MIT;
